   "schema:description":
   [
      {
         "@value":"针对不同类型的应急情况（如地震，火灾，洪水等）进行分类，同时不同的灾害类型所需要的物资类型也不同,
         且在不同的地区，灾害程度也与地理位置有关联，例如广东省是沿海省份，由于地理位置和气候条件，很容易发生洪涝灾害，数据量37MB。",
         "@language":"zh"
      },
      {
         "@value":"Emergency situations are categorized by type (such as earthquakes,
          fires,
          and floods),
          with each disaster requiring specific supplies; furthermore,
          disaster severity varies by region due to geographical factors,
          for instance,
          Guangdong Province,
          being a coastal area with specific climatic conditions,
          is highly prone to flooding,
          and the dataset size is 37MB.",
         "@language":"en"
      }

   ],
